<title>INDONESIA: Polysindo says 1996 net falls.</title>
<headline>Polysindo says 1996 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to December 1996</p>
<p>					 (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net Income			 169.80	vs   210.97</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (rupiah)    95		   191</p>
<p>    Total operating revenue    1,422.67	vs   970.62</p>
<p>    Gross profit		     452.26	vs   299.84</p>
<p>    Operating profit		 386.03	vs   248.62</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		   204.40	vs   141.02</p>
<p>Profit before minority</p>
<p>    interest			   179.83	vs   130.53</p>
<p>    Retained earnings		396.82	vs   294.70</p>
<p>Note: The 1995 figures include a one-time gain on the sale of a subsidiary. The results were audited. PT Polysindo Eka Perkasa is a polyster maker.</p>
</text>
